{"id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nondeterministic-work-space.md","title":"Nondeterministic Work-Space Complexity","display":"df-nondeterministic-space — Nondeterministic Work-Space Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","aliases":["73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","73-df-nondeterministic-space"],"display":"df-nondeterministic-space — Nondeterministic Work-Space Complexity","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</span><span>73-df-nondeterministic-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nondeterministic-space — Nondeterministic Work-Space Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" href=\"?note=2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" title=\"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq2\">\\(k\\geq2\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Run}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{Run}_N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(N)\">\\(L(N)\\)</span> (nondeterministic runs and language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" href=\"?note=2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" title=\"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (space bound)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>输入可访问位置固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\">\\(\\{-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\\)</span>，边界空白格不计入工作空间；原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}\">\\(\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}\\)</span> 接口与左右移动规则保留。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的参数为候选对象；其余机器子句使用上面固定的有效机器。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N\\)</span> 的参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\">\\(\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}\">\\(\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}\">\\(\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{NSPACE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{coNSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{coNSPACE}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\\)</span> 的子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>；它们不对其他字母表的初态函数输入二进制域外的词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\Delta\\,\n\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\Delta\\,\n\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(q,\\mathbf a)\\in(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\\,\n\\forall(q&#39;,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\in Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\bigl((q&#39;,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\in\\Delta(q,\\mathbf a)\\to \\pi_1(\\mathbf b)=\\pi_1(\\mathbf a)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(q,\\mathbf a)\\in(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\\,\n\\forall(q&#39;,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\in Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\bigl((q&#39;,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\in\\Delta(q,\\mathbf a)\\to \\pi_1(\\mathbf b)=\\pi_1(\\mathbf a)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\\to\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\n\\exists q\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land-1\\leq \\pi_1(\\mathbf h)\\leq|w|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\\to\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\n\\exists q\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land-1\\leq \\pi_1(\\mathbf h)\\leq|w|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N(\\rho,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{(j,z)\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\times\\mathbb Z:\n\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\,\\exists q\\in Q\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h)=z\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N(\\rho,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{(j,z)\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\times\\mathbb Z:\n\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\,\\exists q\\in Q\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h)=z\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(|w|\\geq n_0\\land\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\n\\to|\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N(\\rho,m)|\\leq c\\,s(|w|)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(|w|\\geq n_0\\land\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\n\\to|\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N(\\rho,m)|\\leq c\\,s(|w|)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\exists\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\exists\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\exists N\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf2}(T)\\}\\;\n(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,s))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\exists N\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf2}(T)\\}\\;\n(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,s))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{coNSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\mathbf 2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{coNSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\mathbf 2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> forces the existential witness to retain at least one work tape. The uncharged read-only input head is confined to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\">\\(-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\\)</span> on every finite branch, so it cannot encode unbounded auxiliary information.</li>\n<li>The work-space bound applies uniformly to every finite branch, and the separate well-foundedness clause excludes infinite branches.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\\)</span> is stated explicitly here so later comparisons with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\)</span> do not rely on an undeclared class name.</li>\n<li>The shift by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> makes the polynomial bounds positive at input length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> while preserving their asymptotic growth.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Run}_N$ and $L(N)$ (nondeterministic runs and language, see [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Run}_N","display":false},{"tex":"L(N)","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\{-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{coNSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NPSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\Delta\\,\n\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\nN=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\Delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(q,\\mathbf a)\\in(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\\,\n\\forall(q',\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\in Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\bigl((q',\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\in\\Delta(q,\\mathbf a)\\to \\pi_1(\\mathbf b)=\\pi_1(\\mathbf a)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\\to\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\n\\exists q\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land-1\\leq \\pi_1(\\mathbf h)\\leq|w|\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N(\\rho,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{(j,z)\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\times\\mathbb Z:\n\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\,\\exists q\\in Q\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land \\pi_j(\\mathbf h)=z\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(|w|\\geq n_0\\land\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho)\n\\to|\\operatorname{NVisitedWork}_N(\\rho,m)|\\leq c\\,s(|w|)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\,\\exists\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\exists N\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf2}(T)\\}\\;\n(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,s))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{coNSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\\mathbf 2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{NSPACE}(s)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPSPACE}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\mathsf{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"-1,0,\\ldots,|w|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NPSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":5005,"backlinks":[{"id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}$ 见 [[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]；$\\mathsf{NSPACE},\\mathsf{coNSPACE}$ 的全部约束见 [[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]。$\\mathrm{SPACE}(S(n))$ 是以整个函数 $S$ 为参数的兼容写法。"},{"id":"4f6c74e9e6793301","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NSPACE}$ and $\\mathsf{NPSPACE}$ (nondeterministic space classes, see [[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]])"},{"id":"b97e57a60826afa3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NSPACE}$ and $\\mathsf{coNSPACE}$ (nondeterministic space and complement classes, see [[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]])"}],"outgoing":["2f2ad13d4f8c1f98"]}